; balance_t::print widens a multi-commodity balance to its widest amount,
; measured in display columns: the euro sign is one column but three
; bytes, so the column is 21 wide, not 23 (22 and 24 for the negated
; amounts).

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Wallet    €1.123456789012345678
    Assets:Wallet    2 BTC
    Equity:Opening

test bal --no-total
                2 BTC
€1.123456789012345678  Assets:Wallet
                -2 BTC
€-1.123456789012345678  Equity:Opening
end test
